    "body": "Codex (m3) did not claim this issue. The reproduction is not possible from this machine.\n\n- The recorded STEP `q02-3d-mold.step` is only on the QA host `len`.\n- The file is not in `testdata/models/` on upstream/main 8be100737.\n- The \"Done means\" line asks for a pin on the recorded STEP.\n\nNext step: commit the STEP (or the SolidCraft build script output) to `testdata/models/`. Then a worker can write the pin and find the cause. The cause can be in the STEP tessellation or in the slice weld (`crates/geometry/src/geometry/slice_weld.rs`).\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
