    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T09:43:13Z",
    "body": "fix on issue/3034-step-mold-open-slice · PR #3128 · pinned by mesh_deviation_pole::a_fan_at_a_spline_pole_measures_by_its_true_sag, mesh_deviation_pole::a_solid_with_a_spline_pole_meshes_inside_the_tolerance, import_step_spline_pole::a_solid_with_a_spline_pole_imports_closed_and_slices · merges when reviewed\n\nOn upstream/main the import of q02 refused with \"face Some(10) stands 5.089e-1 mm off its surface\". The mesh was good. The deviation measure was wrong at the pole of the ellipsoid boss. With the fix, q02 imports with no open edge and slices at z = 19.6875. The q02 STEP is not in the tree. A quarter-sphere fixture of our own gives the same refusal before the fix.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
